  message: "Folded into WI-gokop-nudub (owner delegated the decision, 2026-09-30): this item's scope (Scala return-type registry for call-result and chained receivers) is a strict subset of WI-gokop, which also covers for-binders and lambda parameters, is P2, and carries a measured baseline. This item's deliverables (Pass-1 method_return_types population, Pass-2 registry read, the _extract_scala_return_type_name helper with generic strip and Option/Try/Future/Either unwrap, implicits deferred) were copied onto WI-gokop, and its `isbefore` WI-hudam was transferred to WI-gokop. Closed wont_do as a duplicate, per the tracker's convention for folds; no work was done here."  # 3bc0
